					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-584484#post-1611491</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-584484/the-only-way-to-travel#post-1611491</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Sat, 10 Nov 2012 03:06:21 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Djoric</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>388108</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm actually kind of surprised as to why &quot;that's classified&quot; isn't used as an excuse more often in other tales. You can get away with so much and still manage to pull it off neatly.</p> <p>Why does the Foundation have a combat zeppelin?</p> <p>That's classified.</p> <p>How the did the Foundation manage to build no less than three high-altitude low-orbit testing facilities <em>and</em> keep them secret? Why would they even do that?</p> <p>That's classified.</p> <p>What's this I hear about an army of cyborg gorillas?</p> <p>That's very classified.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
